OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the visually-impaired actors
OL,4,Acreating pictures through sound
OL,5,
OL,6,FA box of gravel, a handful of leaves
OL,7,Fand a miniature door might not sound
OL,8,Flike the ingredients for a wedding day
OL,9,Fdrama.
OL,11,FBut in a room filled with people
OL,12,Fexperimenting with sounds, they are
OL,13,Fhelping to bring an entire world to
OL,14,Flife.
OL,16,FFor a group of blind and
OL,17,Fpartially-sighted people, an
OL,18,Faudio-based drama workshop is giving
OL,19,Fthem the chance to explore performance
OL,20,F- without relying on visual cues.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
