OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the visually-impaired actors
OL,4,Acreating pictures through sound
OL,5,
OL,6,FInstead, they are using sound to create
OL,7,Fcharacters, settings and stories,
OL,8,Fbuilding a picture in the audience's
OL,9,Fmind without showing them a single
OL,10,Fimage.
